1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,715
Today we have a wonderful walking tour of the sights of this fascinating place.

2
00:00:05,215 --> 00:00:07,960
We will begin with a breakfast together at the Orchid Café.

3
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:17,140
We suggest that you take advantage of the buffet offerings because you will need all of your energy for all the activities we have planned this morning.

4
00:00:17,715 --> 00:00:21,840
Directly after breakfast, we will be walking up Jacob's Ladder to King's Park.

5
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:23,900
It's quite a steep climb.

6
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:30,380
From Rotary Lookout, you will get a stunning view across the city and the river and up to the hills.

7
00:00:30,970 --> 00:00:36,600
We will then continue through the gorgeous natural trail deep into the park to the wild herb garden.

8
00:00:37,525 --> 00:00:40,440
Here you will find a unique collection of native foods and flowers.

9
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:44,620
So please enjoy a hearty breakfast, and then we can get started.
